来给莫忆儿。莫忆儿接过，没有说谢谢，只是努力的咧嘴笑，来表达自己的谢意，笑得高大的女人都有些害羞起来。囧里个囧，光着上身露咪咪不害羞，姐就笑了笑，你害羞个毛啊？傍晚，男人们倾巢而归，许多人都扛着猎物，虽然不及昨天幡戈打的野猪那样庞大，各个种类加在一起却也不少。有野羊、鹿，野兔等等，都是莫忆儿前世只能在动物园看到的动物。但是这些动物都鲜血淋漓的，身上都有被钝器所伤的血口，和男人门手中拿着的武器很吻合。说是武器，其实不过是坚实的木棍把一头磨尖，或是一块类似刀子样的石头，莫忆儿想，这便是石器时代的石刀吧？男人们手里的石刀比女人们的石刀要粗犷很多，很适合男人们宽广的大手。莫忆儿对历史不太了解，只明白自己穿越到了极其原始的地方，连简单的碗筷等生活用具都没有。女人们像昨天一样去迎接打猎回来的男人们，幡戈在人群簇拥下往山洞走来，目光下意识的去寻找昨天带回来的女人。老人咖萨今天也走出了山洞，傍晚柔和的日光让他双眼微迷起来，似乎很是不习惯光线一样。老人们几乎长期待在山洞的深处，即便是白天，光线也很昏暗。今天咖萨能出山洞，让幡戈觉得特别意外。咖萨笑意吟吟的看着幡戈，眼中满是慈爱，像是在看着自己的孩子一样，谈话低声的对他说话，边说，便看向一旁的莫忆儿。莫忆儿能听懂简单的对话，但是太长的，还没有学会，隐隐约约听到几个词，其中有她的名字——莫忆儿，不过发音不是很标准，还有聪明。说这个词的时候，咖萨指了指自己的头。莫忆儿很是自恋的想，咖萨是在对幡戈说自己很聪明吧？其他族人们都已经各自休息或者是处理猎物准备晚饭，好一会儿咖萨和幡戈菜结束谈话。莫忆儿一直状若无事的站在不远处，实则是想听听他们说什么。可是，能听懂的真的很有限。结束了谈话，咖萨直接回了山洞，幡戈则直接朝着莫忆儿走过来，用不是很标准的发音叫道：“木一儿？”“莫忆儿，莫……忆……儿……”莫忆儿用夸张的嘴型展现给幡戈自己名字的读音，据观察，这个幡戈似乎是这个部族的小首领，想要活下去，至少要讨好他们的大BOSS吧！试了几次之后，幡戈终于准确的读出了莫忆儿几个字，然后咧着嘴露出一排洁白的牙齿，对着莫忆儿笑。他的笑容很好看，在被晒黑皮肤的映衬下显得比用了田七还要白。原始野性的帅哥很有男人味，嗯，出去打了一天猎物的臭汗味和血腥味。不过，似乎并不让人讨厌。这里纯净无污染，比那些汽车尾气的味道好闻多了。对于这个救过自己的打BOSS，莫忆儿还是充满好感的，只是有些不太满意被他们禁锢在山洞范围内。晚饭的时候莫忆儿狼吞虎咽着几乎没什么咸味的烤肉，毫无淑女形象。这也怪不得她，这些个原始人竟然每天只吃一顿晚饭，从今天早上到现在，自己都是饿得要命。如此这般，过了五天的时间，莫忆儿在山洞口的墙角上画出了一个‘正’字，她已经完全掌握了这群人的原始语言，她很是兴奋，自己当初学外语的时候可没这种天分。学会了他们语言，能够和这群人交流是莫忆儿最幸福的事情，她先找到自己原始语言的启蒙者咖萨老人，问道：“咖萨，他们为什么要看住我？不让我出去？”莫忆儿本想说监视或者幽禁，但这里没有这两个意义深奥的词语，说了他们也不会明白，所以，只用最简单的语言来表达出自己的意思。嗯，有点纠结呢！“莫忆儿，别多心，他们只是为了你的安全着想，外面有许多强大的野兽，你……很弱小！”咖萨脸上挂着暖心的笑容，几天的相处，让莫忆儿知道他是个很慈祥的老人。其他老人也都很安静、平和，安静得几乎不存在一样，只有去方便才会走出山洞。长时间的不活动让他们看上去都很虚弱，像是随时会离去一般。不过，莫忆儿还是在看起来很慈祥的咖萨眼底看到了一抹深思。显然，这个答案不是真的，或者说不是全部的答案。难道，这群原始人在算计自己吗？正在这个时候，打猎归来的幡戈走了进来，似是习惯，这几天里，他一回来就要和莫忆儿说上几句话。莫忆儿也很习惯性的问候：“回来了，今天都猎到了什么？”“一只鹿，一只野猪，很不错的收获！”幡戈是个开朗的男人，每次见到他都是一脸的笑意。只要有收获，他就是满足的。“嗯，是很不错！”莫忆儿今天白天学会了首领这个词，便问幡戈：“你是部族的首领吗？”虽然心里已经做了肯定，但是莫忆儿还是想确认一下。让人意外的，幡戈竟然摇了头：“不，我不是首领，首领带着几个勇士去换盐巴了，我们已经快没有盐巴了。”哦！怪不得，每天的烤肉吃着淡而无味。而且，吃了几天晚上的烤肉，莫忆儿觉得胃部不太舒适。是不按时吃饭和食物太单一，营养不均衡的缘故吧！“那，幡戈，我可以走出山洞周围吗？远一点的地方？”莫忆儿问着幡戈，目光还扫了咖萨一眼。果然，咖萨和幡戈的目光中都带了点异样，甚至，还有些紧张。“不行吗？”莫忆儿满脸的希望，她也害怕外面的野兽，但是她不会走远，再这样被看住她都要疯了。“你想去哪儿？我可以陪你去！”幡戈终于有所让步，他实在是不想看到莫忆儿那粉嫩如新生儿的脸上露出失望的神色！", "source": "www.quanwenyuedu.io", "source_url": "https://www.quanwenyuedu.io/n/sifuzhengchong-mengguaifujunyangchengji/4.html", "_fixed": true, "content_en": "Chapter 4 To Strive for Freedom In this way, Mo Yi'er began the process of babbling and learning the language. The original language was very complex and unstructured. But because it is the ancestral language of mankind, Mo Yi'er can still master it quickly. It's like instinct, it just needs someone to guide you. After just one day of studying with Kasa, she was able to simply talk to the people in the tribe, and she also learned to say \"water\"! She told the women of the tribe that water is needed for washing. The women don't know how to wash, but the water can still be understood. However, they did not let Mo Yi'er leave. They just used wide leaves to fetch water from somewhere and brought it to Mo Yi'er. Mo Yi'er took it and didn't say thank you. She just tried her best to grin to express her gratitude. The tall woman became a little shy when she smiled. I'm so embarrassed. I'm naked and showing off my breasts. I'm not shy, so I just smiled. Are you so shy? In the evening, the men returned in large numbers, many of them carrying prey. Although it was not as big as the wild boar that Ban Ge shot yesterday, there were quite a few of all types combined. There are wild sheep, deer, hares, etc., which are all animals that Mo Yi'er could only see in the zoo in her previous life. But these animals were all dripping with blood, and their bodies had bloody wounds from blunt objects, which matched the weapons in the men's hands. It is said to be a weapon, but it is actually just a solid wooden stick with one end sharpened, or a stone similar to a knife. Mo Yi'er thought, is this a stone knife from the Stone Age? The stone knives in the hands of men are much rougher than those of women, and are very suitable for the broad hands of men. Mo Yi'er didn't know much about history. She only understood that she had traveled to an extremely primitive place, without even simple utensils such as bowls and chopsticks. The women went to greet the men who came back from hunting just like yesterday. Surrounded by the crowd, Bange walked towards the cave, his eyes subconsciously looking for the women they brought back yesterday. The old man Kasa also walked out of the cave today. The soft sunlight in the evening made his eyes slightly dazzled, as if he was not used to the light. The old people stay in the depths of the cave for almost a long time. Even during the day, the light is very dim. Kasa was able to come out of the cave today, which surprised Bange. Kasa looked at Ban Ge with a smile, his eyes full of love, as if looking at his own child, and spoke to him in a low voice. As he spoke, he looked at Mo Yi'er. Mo Yi'er can understand simple conversations, but they are too long and haven't learned it yet. She vaguely heard a few words, including her name - Mo Yi'er, but the pronunciation was not very standard, and she was smart. When he said this word, Kasa pointed to his head. Mo Yi'er thought narcissistically, is Kasa telling Bange that she is smart? The other tribesmen had already rested or were handling prey and preparing dinner. After a while, Kasa and Hatagona ended their conversation. Mo Yi'er had been standing not far away as if nothing happened, but actually she wanted to hear what they had to say. However, what I can understand is really limited. After the conversation, Kasa went directly back to the cave, while Bange walked directly towards Mo Yi'er and called out in a not very standard pronunciation: \"Mu Yi'er?\" \"Mo Yi'er, Mo... Yi...'er...\" Mo Yi'er used exaggerated mouth movements to show Ban Ge the pronunciation of his own name. According to observations, this Ban Ge seemed to be the little leader of this tribe. If he wanted to survive, he must at least please their big boss! After several attempts, Ban Ge finally read out the words Mo Yi'er accurately, then grinned at Mo Yi'er, revealing a row of white teeth. His smile is beautiful, and it looks whiter against the tanned skin than if he used Tianqi. The raw and wild handsome guy is very manly, well, the smell of sweat and blood after going out to hunt for a day. However, it doesn't seem annoying. It is pure and pollution-free, and smells much better than those car exhausts. Mo Yi'er still had a good impression of this BOSS who had saved her, but she was a little dissatisfied with being imprisoned within the cave. During dinner, Mo Yi'er devoured the almost salty barbecue, showing no ladylike image. This is no wonder to her, these primitive people only eat one dinner every day. From this morning to now, she has been starving to death. In this way, after five days, Mo Yi'er drew the word \"正\" on the corner of the cave entrance. She had completely mastered the original language of this group of people. She was very excited. She did not have such talent when she first learned foreign languages. Learning their language and being able to communicate with this group of people was the happiest thing for Mo Yi'er. She first went to the old man Kasa, the enlightener of her original language, and asked: \"Kasa, why do they want to keep an eye on me? Don't let me out?\" Mo Yi'er wanted to say surveillance or confinement, but there are no two profound words here, and they wouldn't understand it, so she only used the simplest language to express her meaning. Well, I’m a little confused! \"Mo Yi'er, don't worry too much. They are only thinking about your safety. There are many powerful beasts outside, and you... are weak!\" Kasa had a heartwarming smile on his face. After a few days of getting along with him, Mo Yi'er knew that he was a very kind old man. The other old people are also very quiet and peaceful, so quiet that they almost don't exist. They only come out of the cave for convenience. Long periods of inactivity made them all look weak, as if they were about to leave at any moment. However, Mo Yi'er still saw a hint of thoughtfulness in the eyes of the kind-looking Kasa. Obviously, this answer is not true, or not the whole answer. Could it be that these primitive people are plotting against themselves? At this time, Fan Ge came in after returning from hunting. It seemed like he was used to saying a few words to Mo Yi'er as soon as he came back in the past few days. Mo Yi'er also greeted her habitually: \"I'm back, what did you hunt today?\" \"A deer, a wild boar, a very good harvest!\" Ban Ge is a cheerful man, and every time he sees him,", "title_en": "Chapter 4"}